    for path, entry in sorted(write_entries.items()):
        plan_lines.append(
            f"| `{path}` | modify-only semantic consolidation | {entry['max_added_bytes']:,} bytes / {entry['max_added_lines']} lines | {'; '.join(entry['required_content'])} |"
        )
    plan_lines.extend([
        "",
        "## P3 语义复核后继续保护的 fixture",
        "",
    ])
    for path, semantics in sorted(SEMANTICALLY_PROTECTED_FIXTURES.items()):
        plan_lines.append(f"- `{path}`：{semantics}；与 canonical valid fixture 语义不同，不能直接合并删除。")
    plan_lines.extend([
        "",
        "## 五批状态",
        "",
        "| Order | Batch | Status | Remove | Modify | Commit now |",
        "|---:|---|---|---:|---:|---|",
    ])
    for row in batch_rows:
        plan_lines.append(
            f"| {row['order']} | {row['category']} | {row['status']} | {len(row['removal_entries'])} | {len(row['guarded_write_targets'])} | NO |"
        )
    plan_lines.extend([
        "",
        "`frontend_scripts`、`validation`、`generated` 为 `SKIP_NO_SAFE_SCOPE`：不执行、不提交，不为满足五批形式制造空 commit。",
        "",
        "## 预计净减少",
        "",
        f"Gross removal：{metrics['proposed_removal_files']} files / {metrics['proposed_removal_bytes']:,} bytes / {metrics['proposed_removal_lines']} lines。受控写入预算最多 {metrics['write_budget_max_bytes']:,} bytes / {metrics['write_budget_max_lines']} lines，因此预计净减少至少 4 个文件、8,646 bytes、253 行。",
        "",
        f"Before → after lower-bound：tracked files `{baseline_metrics['tracked_files']:,} → {baseline_metrics['tracked_files'] - 4:,}`；Markdown `{baseline_metrics['markdown_files']:,} → {baseline_metrics['markdown_files'] - 4:,}`。public package scripts `{public_script_count} → {public_script_count}`；validate-prefixed scripts `{validate_script_count} → {validate_script_count}`；validator files `{validator_count} → {validator_count}`（OpenAIDatabase `{oai_validator_count} → {oai_validator_count}`）；默认 Codex context `{context_bytes:,} bytes / {context_lines} lines`，净减少 `0`。",
        "",
        "这是一组低风险、低 ROI 的窄清理，不代表完成全量 L4 收敛，也不会显著降低 validator、public scripts 或默认上下文。",
        "",
        "## Deferred 与保护边界",
        "",
        f"- protected_paths.json 精确保护 **7,734** 个 tracked paths；允许变化仅 6 个精确路径。",
        f"- Deferred non-keep：**747**。Gate：`{dict(sorted(deferred_gate_counts.items()))}`。",
        f"- Disposition：`{dict(sorted(deferred_disposition_counts.items()))}`；Batch：`{dict(sorted(deferred_batch_counts.items()))}`。",
        "- 12 个其他 active project prefix、153 个 raw/raw-like 路径、30 个 FINAL_ACCEPTANCE_BUNDLE 路径、全部 inventory protected path 均不可触碰。raw content reads=0。",
        "",
        "## Validation、停止与回滚",
        "",
        "1. S03 开始前同步并重新固定 local BASE 与 live main；任一路径/blob/reference 漂移即回到 S02 审计。",
        "2. 每个 active batch 只允许其 `allowed_changed_paths`，普通单父、单批单 commit；三个空批次不得提交。",
        "3. Documents 必须保留 CHANGELOG 的 v1.1.5 Part 1 Stage 0 版本摘要。",
        "4. Governance 必须在预算内合并 current guidance，并重跑 valid、negative、escape、中文 fixture 与 routing baseline。",
        "5. 先在 disposable clean worktree 演练 apply → validate → `git revert <batch_commit>` → validate；真实工作树不做 pre-cleanup restore rehearsal。",
        "6. 发现 unique fixture、运行依赖、引用、raw、secret、范围外 diff、remote race 或 required validation 失败即停止。",
        "",
        "## 审批矩阵",
        "",
        "1. Approve documents only：只批准 1 个 legacy review 路径。",
        "2. Approve governance conditionally：批准 3 个 operational docs + 2 个 canonical write targets，前提是语义清单和预算全部通过。",
        "3. Approve both batches：仍需 S02 Stage 复审通过并另行授权开始 S03。",
        "4. Reject / request evidence：保持全部路径不变，回到只读审计。",
        "",
        "## GitHub 与 App 边界",
        "",
        "本计划不执行 Stage-level GitHub upload。后续即使形成可独立 revert 的本地 batch commits，也必须等整体 roadmap、raw 与复审全部完成后才一次性同步 GitHub main 并重装 App。",
    ])
